<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72316" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκοδεσπότ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>master</i> or <i>steward of a house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				225
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				10.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMeyer</u>
				24.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span> : metaph., of God, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.22.4
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίας δ.</span> was preferred
			by the Atticists, as in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				954b
			</span></i> : so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκων δεσπόται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				348
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>native ruler,</i> opp. foreign emperor, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astrol., of
			a planet, <i>owner of a domicile</i> or otherwise predominant,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				97
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
			</span></i> Astr.<i><span class="en">
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				3.158.80
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
